CF Jobby Mobilemonero.txt

# Credential backups of relay/.env. Each holds 23-26 live keys
# (Supabase service role, OpenRouter, Resend) and was untracked AND
# unignored, so a git add -A at the root would have committed them.
relay/.env.bak*
local-supabase/.env


# relay/server.js is tracked again as of 2026-10-10 (XMRT Nexus aside work);
# the working copy is canonical — it is what actually runs the stack.

# Runtime JSON state written by the relay (task lists, activity log, session state).
# It changes on every request and is not source.
relay/relay-data/

# resume_server's rotating access/error log. Runtime output, not source.
jobby-mcjobberson/resume_server.log*

# resume_server / vite / proxy logs, and Python bytecode caches.
jobby-mcjobberson/*.log*
jobby-mcjobberson/**/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/

# Derived recognition vectors. Rebuilt from C:\Users\PureTrek\Desktop\Faces\Faces
# by tools/_enrol.py - 33 x 512 floats, all reproducible, and useless without
# the dataset. The provenance sidecar is runtime state that changes on every
# enrolment, so it must not be committed either: a stale shot count checked
# into git is worse than none, because it looks authoritative.
face-service/identities/

